(linear-ecfc)
*title Analytic ECFC constant velocity
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc
    x=20925646.3255 y=100 z=-50 xdt=10 ydt=-2 zdt=1 time=0 mass=10
  *file linear.dat
    time xecfc yecfc zecfc xecfcdt yecfcdt zecfcdt mass
  *print time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.25
    *when time=10 stop
*end
